1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,145
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,145 --> 00:00:10,260
Tissue culture works because plant cells are totipotent, and the auxin to cytokinin ratio decides roots, callus or shoots.

3
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:16,536
Breeders emasculate, bag, cross and select, and hybrids show heterosis.

4
00:00:16,536 --> 00:00:21,341
The Bt toxin is activated only in an insect's alkaline gut.

5
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:24,596
Bio fertilizers are living organisms.

6
00:00:24,596 --> 00:00:36,354
Recombinant DNA uses restriction enzymes, ligase and a plasmid; PCR doubles DNA every cycle; gels sort fragments by size.

7
00:00:36,354 --> 00:00:41,132
And food safety is about quality, food security about access.

